menuconfig LIBPOSIX_THREAD
	bool "posix-thread: pthread affinity extensions"
	depends on LIBUKSCHED
	default n
	help
	  pthread_setaffinity_np()/pthread_getaffinity_np() and the
	  pthread_attr_setaffinity_np()/pthread_attr_getaffinity_np()
	  attribute calls for musl-style pthread handles, on top of the
	  per-thread CPU affinity in lib/uksched.

	  musl itself implements none of these calls. Applications built
	  against musl outside of the unikernel image (for example a
	  static musl ELF running through app-elfloader) must instead
	  compile compat/pthread_affinity_musl.c into the application;
	  see README.md in this directory.